From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ryan Murray <81541646+RyanTheTide@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 01:09:23 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] tests: Add tearing-control tests

A test client binds wp_tearing_control_manager_v1 and the test checks
that the view's frame clock tears only while a fullscreen surface asks
for async presentation: not after switching back to vsync, not while
windowed, not with the async-tearing setting off, and not after the
tearing object is destroyed; "always" and "fullscreen-only" both tear
the fullscreen surface. A second tearing object for the same surface is
the tearing_control_exists protocol error.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
